    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend chapter 306 of the laws of 2011, authorizing owners of residential real property in high risk brush fire areas in the borough of Staten Island to cut and remove reeds from their property, in relation to extending the expiration and repeal date thereof for an additional year",
    "basePrintNo": "S6656",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S6656-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
